#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/Advanced.vue:12
#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:11
msgid "Mount Point URL"
msgstr "Prisijungimo taško URL"

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/Advanced.vue:13
msgid "You can set a custom URL for this stream that AzuraCast will use when referring to it on the web interface and in the Now Playing API return data. Leave empty to use the default value."
msgstr "Galite nustatyti pasirinktinį šio srauto URL, kurį AzuraCast naudos nurodydama jį žiniatinklio sąsajoje ir „Now Playing“ API grąžinamuose duomenyse. Palikite tuščią, kad būtų naudojama numatytoji reikšmė."

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/Advanced.vue:27
msgid "Custom Frontend Configuration"
msgstr "Pasirinktinė sąsajos konfigūracija"

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/Advanced.vue:28
msgid "You can include any special mount point settings here, in either JSON { key: 'value' } format or XML &lt;key&gt;value&lt;/key&gt;"
msgstr "Čia galite įtraukti bet kokius specialius prisijungimo taško nustatymus JSON { key: 'value' } arba XML &lt;key&gt;value&lt;/key&gt; formatu"

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/AutoDj.vue:11
msgid "Enable AutoDJ"
msgstr "Įjungti AutoDJ"

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/AutoDj.vue:12
msgid "If enabled, the AutoDJ will automatically play music to this mount point."
msgstr "Jei įjungta, AutoDJ automatiškai gros muziką šiam prisijungimo taškui."

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/AutoDj.vue:27
#: frontend/components/Stations/Remotes/Form/AutoDj.vue:27
msgid "AutoDJ Format"
msgstr "AutoDJ formatas"

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/AutoDj.vue:34
#: frontend/components/Stations/Remotes/Form/AutoDj.vue:35
msgid "AutoDJ Bitrate (kbps)"
msgstr "AutoDJ bitų dažnis (kbps)"

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:12
msgid "This name should always begin with a slash (/), and must be a valid URL, such as /autodj.mp3"
msgstr "Šis pavadinimas visada turi prasidėti pasviruoju brūkšniu (/) ir turi būti tinkamas URL, pvz., /autodj.mp3"

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:20
msgid "The display name assigned to this mount point when viewing it on administrative or public pages. Leave blank to automatically generate one."
msgstr "Rodomas pavadinimas, priskirtas šiam prisijungimo taškui peržiūrint jį administravimo ar viešuosiuose puslapiuose. Palikite tuščią, kad būtų sugeneruotas automatiškai."

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:27
#: frontend/components/Stations/Remotes/Form/BasicInfo.vue:63
msgid "Show on Public Pages"
msgstr "Rodyti viešuosiuose puslapiuose"

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:28
msgid "Enable to allow listeners to select and play from this mount point on this station's public pages, including embedded widgets."
msgstr "Įjunkite, kad klausytojai galėtų pasirinkti ir groti šį prisijungimo tašką stoties viešuosiuose puslapiuose, įskaitant įterptus valdiklius."

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:35
msgid "Set as Default Mount Point"
msgstr "Nustatyti kaip numatytąjį prisijungimo tašką"

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:36
msgid "If this mount is the default, it will be played on the radio preview and the public radio page in this system."
msgstr "Jei šis prisijungimo taškas yra numatytasis, jis bus grojamas radijo peržiūroje ir viešajame radijo puslapyje šioje sistemoje."

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:43
msgid "Relay Stream URL"
msgstr "Retransliuojamo srauto URL"

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:44
msgid "Enter the full URL of another stream to relay its broadcast through this mount point."
msgstr "Įveskite pilną kito srauto URL, kad jo transliacija būtų retransliuojama per šį prisijungimo tašką."

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:53
#: frontend/components/Stations/Remotes/Form/AutoDj.vue:85
msgid "Publish to \"Yellow Pages\" Directories"
msgstr "Skelbti "Yellow Pages" kataloguose"

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:57
msgid "Enable to advertise this mount point on \"Yellow Pages\" public radio directories."
msgstr "Įjunkite, kad šis prisijungimo taškas būtų reklamuojamas "Yellow Pages" viešuosiuose radijo stočių kataloguose."

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:68
msgid "Max Listener Duration"
msgstr "Maksimali klausytojo prisijungimo trukmė"

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:69
msgid "Set the length of time (seconds) a listener will stay connected to the stream. If set to 0, listeners can stay connected infinitely."
msgstr "Nustatykite laiko tarpą (sekundėmis), kurį klausytojas liks prisijungęs prie srauto. Jei nustatyta 0, klausytojai gali likti prisijungę neribotą laiką."

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:77
msgid "YP Directory Authorization Hash"
msgstr "YP katalogo autorizacijos maiša"

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:81
msgid "If your stream is set to advertise to YP directories above, you must specify an authorization hash. You can manage these on the Shoutcast web site."
msgstr "Jei jūsų srautas nustatytas skelbti aukščiau nurodytuose YP kataloguose, turite nurodyti autorizacijos maišą. Ją galite tvarkyti Shoutcast interneto svetainėje."

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:98
msgid "Fallback Mount"
msgstr "Atsarginis prisijungimo taškas"

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/BasicInfo.vue:99
msgid "If this mount point is not playing audio, listeners will automatically be redirected to this mount point. The default is /error.mp3, a repeating error message."
msgstr "Jei šis prisijungimo taškas negroja garso, klausytojai bus automatiškai nukreipti į šį prisijungimo tašką. Numatytoji reikšmė yra /error.mp3 — pasikartojantis klaidos pranešimas."

#: frontend/components/Stations/Mounts/Form/Intro.vue:2
